1
00:00:05,242 --> 00:00:06,543
Hi, I'm Mark Cerny.
嗨，我是马克·塞尔尼。

2
00:00:06,843 --> 00:00:14,468
I'm excited to be here to talk about the newest addition to our console lineup, PlayStation 5 Pro, and how it advances gaming technology.
我很高兴能在这里介绍我们游戏主机系列的最新产品——PlayStation 5 Pro，以及它如何推动游戏技术的发展。

3
00:00:14,968 --> 00:00:22,453
But first, I want to take just a minute to look at what we put in the original PlayStation 5 and how it delivers an exceptional gaming experience.
不过首先，我想花一点时间回顾一下原版PlayStation 5的特点，以及它如何提供卓越的游戏体验。

4
00:00:26,536 --> 00:00:27,896
When PS5 debuted in 2020,
当PS5于2020年首次推出时，

5
00:00:29,542 --> 00:00:31,083
it brought a lot to the table.
它带来了许多强大的功能。

6
00:00:31,103 --> 00:00:46,813
8 Zen 2 CPU cores form the brains of PlayStation 5 and enable high-speed complex gameplay with character counts reaching into the hundreds and frame rates that can be as high as 120 frames a second.
8个Zen 2 CPU核心构成了PlayStation 5的核心，提供高速复杂的游戏体验，角色数量可达到数百，帧率甚至可以高达每秒120帧。

7
00:00:48,294 --> 00:00:57,520
PS5 has a powerful RDNA 2 GPU which can render anything from intricate details to fantastic worlds with vast panoramas to explore.
PS5配备了强大的RDNA 2 GPU，能够渲染从复杂细节到广阔探险世界的各种内容。

8
00:00:58,402 --> 00:01:08,728
Ray tracing allows for dramatic visual improvements, including reflections off of water or glass, and the realism that comes from real-time global illumination.
光线追踪技术带来了戏剧性的视觉提升，包括水面或玻璃的反射，以及实时全局光照所带来的真实感。

9
00:01:09,849 --> 00:01:24,358
A custom SSD can load data at breathtaking speed, resulting in ultra-fast transitions between game worlds, and data streaming rates so high that traversal speeds are essentially unlimited.
定制SSD以惊人的速度加载数据，实现游戏世界之间的超快速切换，数据流速极高，几乎没有限制。

10
00:01:28,598 --> 00:01:40,523
Tempest 3D audio tech brings an unparalleled sense of immersion to the sound of the games, with audio so real you may not even need to see the enemies to know exactly where they are.
Tempest 3D音频技术为游戏音效带来了无与伦比的沉浸感，音效真实得让你甚至不需要看到敌人就能准确知道他们的位置。

11
00:01:42,964 --> 00:01:50,047
Finally, the DualSense controller has haptics that let you feel through your hands what your character is experiencing inside of the game.
最后，DualSense控制器的触觉反馈让你能够通过手感体验角色在游戏中的感受。

12
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:55,781
It's wonderful to see such variety and richness of game experiences.
看到如此多样化和丰富的游戏体验真是令人兴奋。

13
00:01:56,301 --> 00:02:03,985
Creators have made amazing use of the hardware capabilities, but when I talk to them, I do hear about their desire for more graphics performance.
创作者们充分利用了硬件的能力，但与他们交谈后，我确实听到他们渴望更高的图形性能。

14
00:02:04,806 --> 00:02:14,111
The dreams of the developers are bigger than can be supported at 60 frames per second, and that leads to an aspect of modern gaming that we're all familiar with, graphics modes.
开发者们的梦想超出了60帧每秒所能支持的范围，这导致了现代游戏中我们熟悉的一个方面——图形模式。

15
00:02:14,751 --> 00:02:16,592
It can be a difficult choice for players.
对于玩家来说，选择往往是一个困难的决定。

16
00:02:18,635 --> 00:02:22,699
Fidelity modes emphasize the visuals, typically through higher resolution rendering.
高保真模式强调画面质量，通常通过更高的分辨率渲染来实现。

17
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:27,964
These modes might also have enhanced detail or use more ray tracing.
这些模式可能还会增强细节或使用更多光线追踪技术。

18
00:02:29,345 --> 00:02:31,808
But the games only run at 30 frames per second.
但是游戏只能以每秒30帧运行。

19
00:02:32,208 --> 00:02:35,551
The visuals can be choppier and the controls less responsive.
画面可能较为卡顿，控制响应不够及时。

20
00:02:36,172 --> 00:02:42,118
Performance modes emphasize frame rate and interactivity, typically choosing to run at 60 frames per second.
性能模式则强调帧率和互动性，通常选择以每秒60帧运行。

21
00:02:46,303 --> 00:02:50,382
mainly by reducing the graphical detail until those frame rates can be achieved.
主要是通过降低图形细节来实现这些帧率。

22
00:02:52,881 --> 00:02:57,445
When asked to decide on a mode, players are choosing performance about three-quarters of the time.
当被要求选择模式时，玩家大约在四分之三的时间里选择性能模式。

23
00:02:58,125 --> 00:03:03,790
Removing that decision, or at least narrowing that divide, is one of the key targets for PlayStation 5 Pro.
消除这种决策，或者至少缩小这种差距，是PlayStation 5 Pro的一个关键目标。

24
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:10,535
We want to give players the graphics that the game creators aspire to, at the high frame rates that players typically prefer.
我们希望为玩家提供游戏创作者所追求的图形，同时保持玩家通常偏好的高帧率。

25
00:03:11,056 --> 00:03:16,140
To do that, PS5 Pro substantially improves over PlayStation 5 in three ways.
为此，PS5 Pro在三个方面对PlayStation 5进行了显著改进。

26
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:18,762
Here's what we call the Big Three.
这就是我们所说的“三个关键方面”。

27
00:03:20,066 --> 00:03:24,587
First, we made the GPU much larger and increased the speed of the memory it uses.
首先，我们将GPU的尺寸大幅增加，并提高了其使用的内存速度。

28
00:03:25,047 --> 00:03:28,308
The result is rendering that's up to 45% faster.
结果是渲染速度提高了多达45%。

29
00:03:29,769 --> 00:03:40,472
Second, we made major upgrades to the ray tracing, taking a streamlined and accelerated approach that allows calculation of the rays at double or even triple the speeds of PlayStation 5.
其次，我们对光线追踪技术进行了重大升级，采用了一种简化和加速的方法，使光线计算速度达到了PlayStation 5的两倍甚至三倍。

30
00:03:41,926 --> 00:03:50,773
And finally, we added custom hardware for machine learning and an AI library called PlayStation Spectral Super Resolution, or PSSR for short.
最后，我们增加了定制硬件用于机器学习，以及一个称为PlayStation Spectral Super Resolution（简称PSSR）的AI库。

31
00:03:51,854 --> 00:04:00,662
PSSR analyzes the game images pixel by pixel and can add an extraordinary amount of detail, which boosts the effective resolution of the games.
PSSR逐像素分析游戏图像，可以增加大量细节，从而提升游戏的实际分辨率。

32
00:04:01,718 --> 00:04:14,110
Game creators are adding PS5 Pro support to new and existing titles, and with the big three involved, the results can be pretty amazing, with graphics showing something like fidelity levels of detail, but at double the framerate.
游戏创作者正在为新游戏和现有作品添加PS5 Pro支持，凭借这“三个关键方面”的提升，效果非常惊人，图形细节水平接近高保真，但帧率却是其两倍。

33
00:04:14,711 --> 00:04:17,774
Here's The Last of Us Part II running on PS5 Pro.
这里是《最后的生还者2》在PS5 Pro上的运行效果。

34
00:04:19,055 --> 00:04:23,400
It has huge amounts of detail and targets a super smooth 60 frames per second.
它具有大量细节，并以超流畅的每秒60帧为目标。

35
00:04:25,626 --> 00:04:34,810
Let's compare this to the Fidelity mode on PS5, which is only running at 30 frames per second and is therefore much choppier.
我们将其与PS5上的高保真模式进行比较，后者只能以每秒30帧运行，因此画面显得更为卡顿。

36
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:48,356
This goal of delivering almost Fidelity-like graphics at performance frame rates has been achieved for a broad set of titles, including Marvel's Spider-Man 2 and Ratchet & Clank Rift Apart.
实现几乎高保真画面质量的同时保持高性能帧率的目标，已经在包括《漫威蜘蛛侠2》和《瑞奇与叮当：裂痕分离》在内的多个标题中达成。

37
00:04:48,716 --> 00:04:52,578
We can see that PS5 Pro is close to doubling the power of PlayStation 5.
我们可以看到PS5 Pro的性能几乎是PlayStation 5的两倍。

38
00:04:55,140 --> 00:05:03,244
Another way to compare the two consoles is to look at PS5 Pro versus Performance mode on PS5, both of which target 60 frames per second.
另一种比较这两款主机的方法是看PS5 Pro与PS5上的性能模式，二者均以每秒60帧为目标。

39
00:05:04,644 --> 00:05:06,665
What we see here is a difference in detail.
我们在这里看到的是细节的差异。

40
00:05:07,085 --> 00:05:10,567
PS5 Pro is much sharper and crisper than PS5.
PS5 Pro的画面比PS5更加清晰锐利。

41
00:05:11,927 --> 00:05:15,029
For this, my favorite is the parade scene from Ratchet & Clank.
对于这一点，我最喜欢的是《瑞奇与叮当》中的游行场景。

42
00:05:15,529 --> 00:05:17,630
Distant details are much clearer.
远处的细节更为清晰。

43
00:05:19,215 --> 00:05:26,988
And here we can see Marvel's Spider-Man 2 is noticeably higher resolution throughout the scene, including the trees and procedural cars.
在这里，我们还可以看到《漫威蜘蛛侠2》在整个场景中的分辨率明显提高，包括树木和程序生成的车辆。

44
00:05:29,232 --> 00:05:31,954
So overall, some remarkable improvement to the games.
总体来说，游戏体验有了显著改善。

45
00:05:32,474 --> 00:05:38,258
On PS5 Pro, we can see increased sharpness to the graphics or smoother and more responsive gameplay.
在PS5 Pro上，我们可以看到图形更加锐利，游戏玩法更流畅且响应更快。

46
00:05:38,818 --> 00:05:41,220
This is the big three showing their value.
这就是“三个关键方面”展现其价值的地方。

47
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:49,766
As you've been seeing, machine learning via the PSSR library is being used quite broadly to add pixel detail and boost frame rate.
正如你所看到的，PSSR库通过机器学习被广泛应用于增加像素细节和提升帧率。

48
00:05:50,646 --> 00:05:53,127
But there are as many approaches as there are game engines.
但每个游戏引擎都有多种不同的方法。

49
00:05:53,487 --> 00:05:58,728
The increase in raw GPU power is being especially effective for Horizon Forbidden West.
原始GPU性能的大幅提升尤其对《地平线：禁忌西部》产生了积极影响。

50
00:05:59,308 --> 00:06:12,392
Apart from the detail boost, that extra graphics power is allowing for improvements to lighting and visual effects... ...as well as to the hair and the skin in cinematics.
除了细节的提升，额外的图形性能还改善了照明和视觉效果……以及电影片段中的头发和皮肤表现。

51
00:06:13,052 --> 00:06:13,632
Open up, guys.
开始吧，伙计们。

52
00:06:14,193 --> 00:06:14,793
Jorah's orders.
乔拉的命令。

53
00:06:15,333 --> 00:06:15,793
Good enough for me.
对我而言这已经足够了。

54
00:06:19,150 --> 00:06:21,152
Ray tracing is finding broad usage as well.
光线追踪技术的应用也越来越广泛。

55
00:06:21,412 --> 00:06:28,157
Particularly when the games are focused on higher frame rates, the faster hardware in PS5 Pro can make a real difference.
尤其是当游戏强调更高帧率时，PS5 Pro更强的硬件能够带来显著的提升。

56
00:06:29,658 --> 00:06:38,385
Allowing Gran Turismo 7 to add ray traced reflections between the cars in gameplay, while continuing to support their targeted 60 frames per second.
这使得《Gran Turismo 7》在游戏中能够在赛车之间增加光线追踪反射，同时仍能保持每秒60帧的目标。

57
00:06:39,406 --> 00:06:43,329
That boost in ray tracing is also delivering big wins for Hogwarts Legacy.
光线追踪的增强也为《哈利·波特：遗产》带来了巨大的好处。

58
00:06:44,833 --> 00:06:52,258
allowing not only for better reflections and a greater variety of reflective surfaces, but also for further realism in the casting of shadows.
这不仅带来了更好的反射效果和更丰富的反射表面，还进一步增强了阴影投射的真实感。

59
00:06:54,219 --> 00:06:57,901
I hope you've enjoyed this run-through of the technology behind PlayStation 5 Pro.
希望你们喜欢这次关于PlayStation 5 Pro背后技术的介绍。

60
00:06:58,642 --> 00:07:04,225
Simply put, it's the most powerful console we've ever built, and a worthy addition to the PS5 family.
简而言之，它是我们造过的最强主机，是PS5系列中值得期待的新成员。

61
00:07:04,986 --> 00:07:09,748
Let me wrap this up by giving you a quick look at a number of games running on the new console.
接下来让我快速展示一些在新主机上运行的游戏。

62
00:07:27,677 --> 00:07:32,423
Don't let me hang him.
别让我挂了他。

63
00:07:32,603 --> 00:07:35,927
Run!
快跑！

64
00:07:35,947 --> 00:07:40,573
Close your eyes.
閉上你的眼睛。

65
00:07:42,455 --> 00:07:44,357
It'll be worth it.
这一定会值得的。

66
00:08:51,523 --> 00:08:52,129
PlayStation.
PlayStation。

